Package: CrossPRS
Title: Cross-GWAS Polygenic Risk Score Analysis
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Levi", "Mei", , "levimei88@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for polygenic risk score (PRS) analysis using
    genome-wide association study (GWAS) summary statistics. The package
    supports downloading Neale Lab UK Biobank GWAS summary statistics,
    constructing SNP weights from a source GWAS, and testing associations
    between the resulting PRS and phenotypes in a target GWAS. It
    implements a summary-statistics-based PRS association method that
    estimates the PRS effect, standard error, Z statistic, and p-value
    without requiring individual-level genotype or phenotype data.
